!Series_overall_design = OCI-AML5-Cas9 EKO library cells were treated with compounds (UM171 and Dexamethasone) and DMSO as control for 14 days. Cells were pelleted every 2 days and DNA was extracted. ID sequences of the sgRNAs were amplified by PCR and the products were sent for sequencing in Illumina NextSeq 500
